#: ../recording.rst:155
msgid ""
"Chooses WAV, FLAC, or MP3. FLAC is lossless with smaller files than WAV."
msgstr ""
"Choisit WAV, FLAC ou MP3. FLAC est sans perte avec des fichiers plus petits "
"que WAV."

#: ../recording.rst:156
msgid "Sample Rate"
